{"id":"5b4178d75957ed66","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pattern.md","title":"Patterns and DNF theories of partial Boolean functions","display":"df-pattern — Patterns and DNF theories of partial Boolean functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pattern","aliases":["27-df-pattern"],"display":"df-pattern — Patterns and DNF theories of partial Boolean functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-pdbf]]","[[27-df-term]]","[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-pdbfpi]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.3 Patterns and theories of pdBfs","source_printed_pages":"518–519","source_pdf_pages":"542–543","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pattern"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pattern</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pattern — Patterns and DNF theories of partial Boolean functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04f9638612cfbb2f\" href=\"?note=04f9638612cfbb2f\" title=\"27-df-pdbfpi\">27-df-pdbfpi</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.3 Patterns and theories of pdBfs"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"518–519"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"542–543"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\((T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span>；项、DNF 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"04f9638612cfbb2f\" href=\"?note=04f9638612cfbb2f\" title=\"27-df-pdbfpi\">27-df-pdbfpi</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a> 的有限项集族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\mid\\exists a\\in T\\;(U(a)=1)\\land\\forall b\\in F\\;(U(b)=0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\mid\\exists a\\in T\\;(U(a)=1)\\land\\forall b\\in F\\;(U(b)=0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)\\land\\forall a\\in T\\;\\exists U\\in D\\;(U(a)=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)\\land\\forall a\\in T\\;\\exists U\\in D\\;(U(a)=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\mid D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\mid D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里 theory 是样本的模式覆盖 DNF，不能混作现有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1a53bf759f98ac24\" href=\"?note=1a53bf759f98ac24\" title=\"27-df-theory\">27-df-theory</a> 的一阶语义理论。每个模式都须覆盖至少一个正样本；这比“任意总扩张的任意 DNF”要求更强。prime pattern 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"04f9638612cfbb2f\" href=\"?note=04f9638612cfbb2f\" title=\"27-df-pdbfpi\">27-df-pdbfpi</a> 的原有 PI(T,F) 接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","an